                <pb facs="0371" n="1105" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1105"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure to inclosure 1 in No.
                        157.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Article 325, Penal Code.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Whoever absents himself from his fatherland and enters foreign service without
                    the permission of the Government, or becomes subject of a foreign power, is
                    condemned for such violation of duty and oath of faithful subjection to the
                    privation of all civil rights and to perpetual banishment from the territory of
                    the Empire, or, in case of voluntary return to Russia, to deportation to
                    Siberia.</p>
            </div>
